<title>USA: Loehmann's combined same-store sales rose.</title>
<headline>Loehmann's combined same-store sales rose.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loehmann's Inc said on Monday that combined comparable store-sales for August and September rose 3.4 percent.</p>
<p>The company said that combined sales for the months of August and September increased 12 percent to $73.2 million from $65.4 million in the comparable period in 1995.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
